• Familiarity R &amp; Python, including use of packages such as pandas, numpy, scipy &amp; matplotlib &nbsp;

• Knowledge of market research methodologies &nbsp;

• Experience with cloud technologies, such as BigQuery, GCP &amp; AWS &nbsp;

• Experience working with predictive models and data sources via APIs &nbsp;

• Speaking any European languages &nbsp;

